Note the CLI prints the message types with prefixes: "Warning: ", "Deprecated: ", "Notice: ", "Fatal error: ", "Parse error: ". In non-CLI (html) it'd be "PHP Warning: ". CLI uses no "PHP " prefix. Let me confirm "PHP Notice"? Since CLI: no prefix.

